OpenDungeons_Version:0.7.1  # The version of OpenDungeons which created this file (for compatibility reasons).

[Info]
Name	Gloomkeep
Description	A sunken fortress of cells and chains stands in the middle of this land, and its owners left traps on every road to their hoard. Take prisoners, learn the traps by their sound and dig your own way to the gold. Build as you like; nothing here ends the game.
Music	Searching_yd.ogg
FightMusic	TheDarkAmulet_MP.ogg
Sandbox	1
SandboxRealm	Gloomkeep
SandboxTarget	50000
SandboxBonus	prisoners	10	10000	-	Hold ten prisoners at once
SandboxBonus	trapsFired	20	10000	-	Set off twenty traps
SandboxNext	skirmish/Wyrmhollow.level
[/Info]

