[Trigger]
Name	hello
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Gloomkeep, master. A fortress of cells lies in the middle of the land, and the old owners left traps on both roads to their hoard. Take prisoners, and watch your step.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	compound
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Compound
Action	message	1	The cell block. Three prisons and two torture rooms stand ready here. Claim them and you can hold whatever you capture.
Action	reveal	1	Hoard
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	east
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RoadEast
Action	message	1	You hear cannons being wound up. This road is trapped along its whole length.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	south
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	RoadSouth
Action	message	1	The south road is trapped as well, and a hero portal waits at its end.
Action	gold	1	300
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	springs
Mode	once
Cond	region	1	Springs
Action	message	1	A pool lies in this cave. A good place to keep a few creatures away from the roads.
[/Trigger]
[Trigger]
Name	springsWell
Mode	once
Cond	slabs	1	Springs	claimed	>=	25
Action	message	1	The springs are claimed and one of them runs with mana now. Claim it with a worker.
Action	terrain	82	21	82	21	manawell
[/Trigger]
[/Triggers]
